{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:0.2", "PA_ja_248:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs, The Chapter on the Jackal (Siṅgālavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:0.4"], "en": "8. The Kiṁsuka-Tree Simile Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:1.1"], "en": "“The kiṁsuka tree has been seen by all;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:1.2"], "en": "why then do you have doubt about it?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:1.3", "PA_ja_248:1.4"], "en": "\"For a charioteer is not questioned about every single point;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:2.1"], "en": "even so it is with all forms of knowledge.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:2.2"], "en": "Those by whom the teachings have not been understood,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:2.3"], "en": "they indeed waver regarding those teachings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:2.4"], "en": "like brothers [quarreling] over a *kiṃsuka* tree.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_248:3.1"], "en": "The Kiṁsukopama Jātaka, the eighth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
